Keep a shared captures as 0.

To sweep from spot (a whole number) with step (a whole number) and steps (a whole number).
The cursor is spot plus step, while remaining is steps, while open is 0.
Repeat while remaining is more than 0 and open is 0.
The row is cursor divided by 8, while the column is cursor modulo 8.
The line is item row of board.
The symbol is the slice of line from column to column plus 1.
If symbol matches "p", add 1 to captures, set open to 1.
If symbol matches "R", set open to 1.
Set cursor to cursor plus step.
Set remaining to remaining minus 1.

The rook is -1.
For every spot from 0 to 63.
The row is spot divided by 8, while the column is spot modulo 8.
The line is item row of board.
The symbol is the slice of line from column to column plus 1.
If symbol matches "R", set rook to spot.

The rank is rook divided by 8, while the file is rook modulo 8.
Sweep from rook with -8 and rank.
Sweep from rook with 8 and 7 minus rank.
Sweep from rook with -1 and file.
Sweep from rook with 1 and 7 minus file.
Show captures.
